{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12204290","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12204290","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:2:1220429001:0":{"text":"Keep some of your men here to disguise as the guards, so it looks like the hostage is still here.","source_cn":"你留几个人假扮成守卫，伪装成人质还在这里的样子。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB87550DD67D85724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1220429002:0":{"text":"Understood, boss.","source_cn":"好的，二当家。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29AAD7AEB795D3E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1220429003:0":{"text":"Keep your mouths shut; no word should reach the bookie, clear?","source_cn":"都把嘴封严了，不准有一点消息传到庄家那里，明白吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5B7324F708EB53AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1220429004:0":{"text":"Yes, Lucca!","source_cn":"明白，二当家！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA70F369BC51F6AA9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1220429005:0":{"text":"Lucca, the bookie needs to learn a lesson. Why keep this a secret?","source_cn":"卢卡先生，庄家知道被打疼了才会心有忌惮，为什么要隐藏消息？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBC869542998B17F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1220429006:0":{"text":"Listen well—to thoroughly solve a problem, you need at least two of these three: a ton of money, a precise plan, and absolute power.","source_cn":"听好了，想要彻底解决一件事，大量的钱、精密的计划和绝对...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x29EE987A0F2D425D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1220429007:0":{"text":"Sonja taught me this. I used to rely on strength alone and it cost me dearly, so I kept this in mind.","source_cn":"这是索尼娅教会我的。我过去只懂得依靠力量，吃了大亏，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF306D0A930D4FECB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1220429008:0":{"text":"Remember, kid. Whether in Rustport or elsewhere, relying on brute force without thinking things through won't get you anywhere.","source_cn":"小子，记住，无论是在锈锚港还是别的地方，只靠蛮力不动脑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1E29C879D4A9181F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1220429009:0":{"text":"As for why our actions must be hidden, think about it for yourself.","source_cn":"至于为什么要隐藏消息，你自己好好想想吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC121385DD4E741F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1220429010:0":{"text":"... I understand, sir.","source_cn":"……我、我知道了，卢卡先生。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25917A9BEC2FCD63","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:卢卡":{"text":"Lucca","source":"卢卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮暗哨":{"text":"Carmine Sentry","source":"血薇帮暗哨","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:血薇帮成员":{"text":"Whisper Member","source":"血薇帮成员","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:地下拳手斯坦顿":{"text":"Boxer Stanton","source":"地下拳手斯坦顿","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":11,"localized_text_count":10,"speaker_count":4}}